{"id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-lk.md","title":"k变量逻辑 L^k","display":"df-lk — k变量逻辑 L^k","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-lk","aliases":["29-df-lk"],"display":"df-lk — k变量逻辑 L^k","depends_on":["[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-bound-variable]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 6.9, pp.94–95, DjVu scans 109–110","source_basis":"原书有限变量片段陈述已与文本层核对；以下采用可整体换名的至多 k 个变量名接口"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-lk"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-lk</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lk — k变量逻辑 L^k"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"85d0fb57b7114042\" href=\"?note=85d0fb57b7114042\" title=\"29-df-bound-variable\">29-df-bound-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 6.9, pp.94–95, DjVu scans 109–110"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书有限变量片段陈述已与文本层核对；以下采用可整体换名的至多 k 个变量名接口"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau\\)</span> 见所列依赖；变量名的出现包括自由出现和束缚出现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L^k_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\mid|\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\varphi)|\\leq k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L^k_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\mid|\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\varphi)|\\leq k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.9，印刷页94–95、扫描页109–110，以固定名字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_k\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\)</span> 定义有限变量片段。本库保留原来的“至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个不同名字”接口；任一这样的公式可对全部名字作单射统一换名，变成仅使用固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个名字的公式，反之亦然。不同量词可重复使用同一名字，不能将量词个数当作变量数。词汇参数现在显式绑定；未要求函数词汇上有有限多个有界秩类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bound-variable","status":"resolved","id":"85d0fb57b7114042","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bound-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"L^k_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\mid|\\mathrm{FV}_\\tau(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_\\tau(\\varphi)|\\leq k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-lk]]、[[29-df-ck]] — `L^k` 与 `C^k`"},{"id":"083aeefac65087f4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L^k_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-lk]]，$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 为闭 FO 句子；满足关系见 [[29-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aee8e6e7d497c632","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L^k_\\tau$ 为 [[29-df-lk]] 的公式集；本条只比较其中的闭句。"},{"id":"3b8892bc156b282c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L^3_{\\tau_{<,S}}$ (see [[29-df-lk]])"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-lk]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-lk]]"}],"outgoing":["a3fa1d78e657e6a2","db2b32546860e623","85d0fb57b7114042","28e86a5f0243a0ae"]}